_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/752b889fcc889b17e0d5d39b589478f4.avif?t=1755085073\" width=600 height=75 /></span>People don't only lose treasures - help nature by picking up trash and watch animals come back to their former habitats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/21bf27b1bfa4252cfc0a0385cdffe4fa.avif?t=1755085073\" width=600 height=75 /></span>At your cozy home you can sell artifacts, accept new missio